    "created_at": "2018-10-15T02:12:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-10-15T02:12:46Z",
    "body": "I'm negative of supporting the IP address form of email addresses in the HTML platform.\r\n\r\n* I guess many web applications don't support this form of email addresses.\r\n* It's easy to make such element by ```<input type=text pattern=...>```\r\n",
