    "created_at": "2018-10-15T07:47:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-10-15T07:47:41Z",
    "body": "I realize it's easy to use `<input type=text pattern=...>` but shouldn't the spec allow all valid emails to reduce surprises?\r\n\r\nJust to note, the W3C spec allows such emails: https://github.com/w3c/html/issues/1638#issuecomment-429126601",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
